<title>ITALY: Tecnost Q1 sales down at 32 billion lire.</title>
<headline>Tecnost Q1 sales down at 32 billion lire.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy's Tecnost, controlled by information technology group Olivetti, said sales in the first quarter of 1997 fell to 32.3 billion lire, down 3.6 percent from the first quarter of the previous year.</p>
<p>The group said in a statement that net financial liquidity at March 31 rose 4.8 billion lire compared with December 31 1996 and 19.8 billion lire compared to March 31 1996.</p>
<p>Tecnost operates in the field of specialised information technology systems.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
